{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28072","headline":"东斋夜宴酬绍之起居见赠 · 杨发","name":"东斋夜宴酬绍之起居见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙门八上不知津，唯有君心困益亲。\n白社追游名自远，青袍相映道逾新。\n十年江海鱼缄尽，一夜笙歌凤吹频。\n渐老旧交情更重，莫将美酒负良辰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨发","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28072.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28072","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}